      "sourceTextSha256": "03a97b8273760d36ed62bfc175244278defd399ad4c276eed6cc41c51f2d0022",
      "text": "The Lagartococha trail and Indigenous traditions; a canoe ride through a swamp with caimans and capybaras; piranha fishing. In the afternoon, a silent canoe ride through the flooded forest among squirrel, capuchin and howler monkeys, then a wooden tower of about 40 m built around a giant kapok tree, with sunset over Mount Sumaco and a magical night canoe ride back. (B, L, D)",
